### Test 1: Change Status Bulk - Disable several units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 0 },
    { "unitId": 2, "unitStatus": 0 }
  ]
}

### Test 2: Change Status Bulk - Re-enable several units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 1 },
    { "unitId": 2, "unitStatus": 1 }
  ]
}

### Test 3: Change Status Bulk - Different status per unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 0 },
    { "unitId": 2, "unitStatus": 3 }
  ]
}

### Test 4: Change Status Bulk - Partial result (one unit not accessible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 0 },
    { "unitId": 999999, "unitStatus": 0 }
  ]
}

### Test 5: Change Status Bulk - Invalid (empty list)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": []
}

### Test 6: Change Status Bulk - Invalid (duplicated unitId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 0 },
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 1 }
  ]
}

### Test 7: Change Status Bulk - Invalid (status out of catalog)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/changeStatusBulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": [
    { "unitId": 1, "unitStatus": 0 },
    { "unitId": 2, "unitStatus": 99 }
  ]
}
